src/main.inset:9:5-9:9
`http` is marked `#[handed_down]` but no child receives it
nothing moves this field into a child
help: move it into a child with `http: move http`, or remove `#[handed_down]`

src/main.inset:11:34-11:38
`http` is handed down, so `Greeter` does not keep it
a `#[handed_down]` field is passed straight to a child
help: use the field in the child it is moved into, or send that child a message
